===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Towards the wind, or the direction from which the wind is blowing.
#: {{ux|en|The '''windward''' boat must give way to the leeward boat.}}
# On the side exposed to the wind.
#: {{ux|en|the '''windward''' bedroom.}}

